als are releasing biased non  peer-reviewed data to advance their  personal financial interests without  regard for the public's health I  completely agree with these statements  because these individuals presented so  much misinformation that it's further  gonna confuse the general public let me  explain why the information these  doctors presented is just not  scientifically act  look the fact that they tested 5000  patients in their urgent care centers  and 6% of them tested positive for Cova  19 makes a lot of sense and it's  actually probably accurate but what's  not accurate and what does it make sense  is to then take 6% that number and  assume that if you test all of New York  State or all of California then 6% of  those people will also test positive  that's just not how statistics work the  people that go to an urgent care center  are more likely to test positive because  they're showing symptoms because they  likely had exposure to kovat 19 that's  why they're there in general when you're  testing a pre-selected population like  that you're gonna have higher numbers  it's like assuming that if you go to  Southern California and gather the  weather data you can then extrapolate it  and assume that the weather is the same  in New York and then with the incorrect  assumption that 6 percent of the general  public must be kovat positive they go on  to calculate a fatality rate that's  similar to the flu let me go ahead and  explain to you how we calculate a death  rate so it all makes sense first we take  all the people who've died with kovat 19  and we divide that number by all the  people who have been infected with kovat  19 let's run an example here if 10  people have died of kovat 19 and a  thousand have been infected either by 10  by a thousand and you get 1% it makes a  1% death rate now if you incorrectly  assume that way more people have had  kovat 19 than is true you can  artificially lower this death rate my  second issue is let's go ahead and  assume their calculations are correct  they're not it doesn't change the fact  that kovat 19 is still much more  dangerous than the flu reason being that  colvett 19 spreads out at two to three  times faster rate than the flu which  means that it can overwhelm our hospital  systems in the blink of an eye in fact  that's what the purpose of all these  lockdowns were to ease the strain on our  hospital systems so we can continue  taking care of patients that are not  only suffering with kovat but with all  the other medical elements out there if  you would have been in a car accident  there's been no one to help you if you  call for a heart attack there would have  been no one to help you we must also  remember that for the flu we have a  vaccine we have an fda-approved  treatment so by maintaining the lockdown  for a slightly longer period of time  we're buying Thai  in order to get there to get the vaccine  and to get the treatments authorized  these are all the reasons why I've been  consistently saying on my youtube  channel to my patients on television  that while COBIT 19 looks similar to the  flu to virus upper respiratory symptoms  they are not the same they are  fundamentally different in that kovat 19  spreads so quickly and puts such a  tremendous strain on our healthcare  system that it can break it in fact I'd  love for these emergency medicine  physicians who are no longer working in  emergency rooms to come to New York City  and talk to the ER doctors that are  working on the front lines to see how  overwhelmed they were with this  apparently mild virus during its peak  let's move on to the topic of reopening  America these individuals are adamant  about reopening America right now  because they're talking about the  negative consequences that are happening  as a result of this lockdown social  issues like domestic violence and child  abuse patients not being able to get  care because they're worried about  getting sick with kovat routine  procedures being 